/*
    Profile `short` (with `hazel`): gate runs. Every process capped at 1 h on compute_partners / short QOS, whatever it
    asks for (resourceLimits trims the request; it does not change any script, so the task hash is unaffected).
*/
process {
    resourceLimits = [ cpus: 16, memory: 120.GB, time: 1.h ]
}
